abstract: >
  EVMx is an FPGA-based Ethereum Virtual Machine (EVM) accelerator designed to
  offload and parallelize smart contract execution. The architecture preserves
  the stack-based model of the EVM and achieves improved area efficiency,
  reduced latency, and high throughput on Xilinx Zynq UltraScale+ devices.
  This repository contains synthesizable VHDL source files, testbenches,
  simulation scripts, and documentation for reproducible FPGA implementation
  and evaluation.
